data-*/
# package-lock.json is deliberately COMMITTED. This service custodies encrypted
# private keys, so `npm install` re-resolving semver ranges on every build — a
# different dependency tree in production than the one that was reviewed — is
# not an acceptable property. See the lockfile note in the Dockerfile.

